The taxi stops.
This is my new building.
It is quiet here at night.
There is a gate there.
Near the gate is an elderly watchman.
He comes near me.
He asks, "Who are you?"
I say, "I am the new resident."
"My name is Maya."
The watchman smiles.
"Welcome," he says.
My suitcase is very heavy.
He takes the suitcase.
He helps.
"Thank you."
I ask, "Where are the stairs?"
He points ahead.
He says, "The stairs are there."
He is very kind.
I go inside.
